tik bahasa Indonesia secara mendalam</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0,3\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c548562702=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"3\" style=\"font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0,4\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\">.&nbsp;</span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0,5\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><span class=\"citation-409\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0,6\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><span class=\"citation-409\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\">Melalui metode&nbsp;</span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0,6\" data-index-in-node=\"15\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><span class=\"citation-409\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\">Fine-Tuning</span></span><span class=\"citation-409\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\">, model ini \"dilatih kembali\" menggunakan dataset spesifik dari media sosial agar memiliki kemampuan&nbsp;</span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0,6\" data-index-in-node=\"127\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><span class=\"citation-409\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\">pemahaman konteks</span></span><span class=\"citation-409\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\">&nbsp;yang tinggi</span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"2,1,0,7\" style=\"line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c548562702=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"4\" style=\