(1127, '<div><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 21.3pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Batasan Masalah Kurang Tegas<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 35.45pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings;\">§<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span>Permasalahan: Belum menjelaskan:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 49.65pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span>Jumlah dan jenis data.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 49.65pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span>Siapa pengguna sistem.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 49.65pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span>Metode fuzzy yang dipilih dan alasan.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 21.3pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Latar Belakang Masih Umum<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 35.45pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings;\">§<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span>Permasalahan:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 49.65pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span>Penjabaran peran Inspektorat terlalu banyak menjelaskan tupoksi kelembagaan, bukan masalah teknis yang akan diselesaikan.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 49.65pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span>Belum jelas apa kesulitan utama dalam menentukan prioritas pemeriksaan (manual, subyektif, lambat, tidak adil?).<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 35.45pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings;\">§<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span>Saran Mas yaa:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 49.65pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span>Paparkan kondisi eksisting yang spesifik (misal: belum ada sistem, hanya pakai Excel, atau pakai feeling).<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 49.65pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span>Gunakan data jika ada (contoh: “dari 20 OPD yang diperiksa tiap tahun, hanya 5 yang diprioritaskan tanpa dasar sistematis”).<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p></div><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><br></p><h3 data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1990\" class=\"\"><br></h3>', '/ekapta-app-new/storage/app/public/lampirans/9s5TVbict8taMGh1jDlqSCzGOx5VySceRQZaJmfU.pdf', NULL, '2025-04-25 02:21:10', '2025-05-06 17:09:54', '2025-05-06 17:09:54', 1463, 19),
