(1230, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 39pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></b>Judul Kurang Konsisten Penulisannya<b><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Di halaman awal dan header tidak ditulis dengan konsisten (misal: tanda kurung di akhir tidak ditutup).<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Perbaikan:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Judul yang benar sebaiknya:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">“Perancangan Sistem Prediksi Penjualan Berbasis Web Menggunakan Metode Single Exponential Smoothing (Studi Kasus: Toko Sinar Gemilang)”<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 39pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></b>Typo dan Ejaan<b><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Beberapa kesalahan pengetikan:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 74.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>“mengurangin” → seharusnya mengurangi<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 74.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>“mengidikasikan” → seharusnya mengindikasikan<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran: Gunakan pemeriksaan ejaan otomatis atau proofreader.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 39pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Tahun Data Tidak Masuk Akal<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Disebutkan: “data historis penjualan dari Januari 2025 sampai April 2025” — ini masa depan (sementara sekarang Mei 2025).<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Solusi: Revisi menjadi:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">“Data historis penjualan dari Januari 2024 hingga April 2024”<br>(atau sesuai data riil yang sudah dimiliki)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 39pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\">4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Rumusan Masalah Bagus Tapi Bisa Diperjelas<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Sudah cukup baik, tapi bisa dibuat lebih tajam:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 74.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Misalnya:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 90pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Wingdings;\">§<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp; </span></span>Bagaimana mengevaluasi tingkat akurasi hasil prediksi menggunakan MAPE sebagai indikator performa sistem?<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 39pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\">5.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Tidak Dijelaskan Mengapa Memilih SES (di Tujuan/Batasan)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Sementara di latar belakang ada kutipan bagus tentang SES, namun tidak ada pembenaran khusus mengapa tidak memilih metode lain (misal: MA, DEMA, Holt).<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran: Tambahkan kalimat seperti:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 3cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Metode SES dipilih karena karakteristik data tidak mengandung pola musiman maupun tren, sehingga lebih sesuai dibanding metode yang lebih kompleks.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 39pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">6.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></b>Sistematika Penulisan Terlalu Deskriptif<b><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Kalimat seperti \"Sub bab ini menjelaskan...\" dan \"Tujuannya adalah untuk memberikan gambaran awal...\" terdengar naratif non-ilmiah.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran perbaikan:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 70.9pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Bab I berisi latar belakang, rumusan masalah, batasan, tujuan, manfaat penelitian, dan sistematika penulisan sebagai fondasi pemahaman terhadap topik yang dikaji.<o:p></o:p></p>', '/ekapta-app-new/storage/app/public/lampirans/IXDQCzRIDjzdRLGELY5bwN2bCuV0XHl3SAIDGsnG.pdf', NULL, '2025-05-27 22:56:46', '2025-05-28 03:58:52', '2025-05-28 03:58:52', 1881, 19),
(1231, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Batasan Masalah Kurang Teknis<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Masalah: Sudah menyebut jumlah data dan metode, tapi belum menyebut:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 72pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Bahasa pemrograman<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 72pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Format file atau platform pengumpulan data (scraping? API?)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran Tambahan:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">“Pengumpulan data dilakukan dengan teknik web scraping terhadap halaman Google Maps menggunakan Python dan library requests, BeautifulSoup, atau Selenium.”<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Sistematika Penulisan Kurang Konsisten<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Masalah: Di sistematika penulisan (1.6) tidak menyebutkan subbab tujuan penelitian, padahal itu bagian penting Bab I.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran: Perbaiki redaksi agar menyebutkan seluruh isi Bab I secara utuh.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Tidak Disebutkan Rencana Evaluasi Performa Visual<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2653\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Tujuan menyebutkan visualisasi distribusi sentimen, tapi belum jelas:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 72pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Apakah menggunakan diagram batang, pie chart, word cloud?<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran Tambahan: Tuliskan bahwa visualisasi dilakukan untuk mendukung interpretasi hasil klasifikasi dan insight pengguna.<o:p></o:p></p>', '/ekapta-app-new/storage/app/public/lampirans/0nkvUTwyVNSVpb3P62AOmnlkHfxrTpeEW6Zmh1Ec.pdf', NULL, '2025-05-27 23:47:57', '2025-05-28 04:49:25', '2025-05-28 04:49:25', 1707, 19),
(1232, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Bagian Implementasi Fuzzy Mamdani Terlalu Tumpang Tindih di Kajian Teori<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Masalah: Penjabaran teknis yang sangat detail tentang input risiko, fungsi keanggotaan, rule base, dan metode centroid sudah masuk ke ranah BAB III atau IV.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Solusi:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 78pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Pindahkan sebagian ke BAB III (Metodologi), cukup beri pengantar konsep di Bab II.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 78pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Misalnya: “Fungsi keanggotaan akan digunakan dengan bentuk triangular dan trapezoidal…” → cukup dikenalkan tanpa angka/rentang konkret.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Beberapa Kalimat Terlalu Naratif, Kurang Akademik<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Contoh:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1848\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 78pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>\"Maka disinilah pentingnya...\" → sebaiknya diganti dengan:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 78pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>\"Oleh karena itu, diperlukan sistem yang mampu memfasilitasi pemilihan entitas pemeriksaan secara objektif dan terstruktur.\"<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Solusi: Rapikan struktur kalimat dan gunakan bahasa impersonal formal.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Definisi Website Terlalu Dasar dan Terlalu Umum<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Penjelasan web (2.1.4) terlalu sederhana dan bersifat sejarah umum. Tidak perlu pembahasan seperti hyperlink, GUI, klik mouse, dsb.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran: Ringkas bagian ini dan fokuskan pada fungsionalitas web-based system dalam konteks aplikasi SPK.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\">4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Bagian Tools (XAMPP, Laravel, VSCode) Terlalu Panjang<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Beberapa subbab hanya menyampaikan dokumentasi/manual tool.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran: Ringkas dan hanya soroti bagian tools yang memang digunakan dalam pengembangan sistem.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\">5.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Tabel Use Case, Activity, Sequence Kurang Terhubung dengan Sistem Nyata<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Masalah: Tabel-tabel simbol UML bersifat teoritis dan tidak dikaitkan langsung dengan sistem yang dibangun.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 2cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -14.15pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran: Singkatkan bagian teori simbol dan fokus pada bagaimana diagram digunakan untuk menggambarkan:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 78pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Interaksi APIP dengan sistem<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 78pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -21.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&n