(1424, 'Lanjut Bab Berikutnya', '/ekapta-app-new/storage/app/public/lampirans/xbZm9uc3foqdPfCHlBVWFCjuNqWpSJOYBleozRwI.pdf', NULL, '2025-06-23 07:33:23', '2025-06-23 15:05:16', '2025-06-23 15:05:16', 1894, 19),
(1425, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Bab II Terlalu Luas dan Kurang Fokus<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Bab ini mencakup teori-teori yang&nbsp;tidak langsung relevan&nbsp;atau terlalu dasar:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 72pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Penjelasan tentang&nbsp;web browser, PHPMyAdmin, CSS, HTML, bahkan logo aplikasi&nbsp;seharusnya berada di&nbsp;Bab 3 (Metodologi atau Implementasi Sistem), bukan di Bab II.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 72pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>IMK dan Visual Studio Code bisa disebut&nbsp;singkat saja&nbsp;jika tidak menjadi fokus sistem.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran: Pindahkan bagian-bagian teknis seperti \"XAMPP\", \"HTML\", \"PHP\", \"VS Code\", dll ke&nbsp;Bab III atau Lampiran, dan fokuskan Bab II pada teori&nbsp;prediksi, manajemen persediaan, dan fuzzy logic.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Kekeliruan Subjudul dan Penomoran<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Sub-bab&nbsp;2.1.9&nbsp;dipakai dua kali untuk&nbsp;Model Waterfall&nbsp;dan&nbsp;Konsep Basis Data.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Ada subjudul&nbsp;2.1.17&nbsp;dan seterusnya yang berisi materi implementasi perangkat lunak.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran: Koreksi&nbsp;penomoran subbab, dan buat konsisten sesuai sistematika ilmiah<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Konsep Fuzzy Mamdani Masih Bisa Diperdalam<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Belum dijelaskan&nbsp;contoh konkret&nbsp;dari aturan fuzzy Mamdani dalam konteks persediaan menu (misal: “IF permintaan tinggi AND stok rendah THEN produksi banyak”).<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Tidak ada&nbsp;ilustrasi grafik fungsi keanggotaan&nbsp;(misalnya segitiga, trapezium).<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran: Tambahkan:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 90pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Contoh aturan fuzzy dari sistem yang dibangun<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 90pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Visualisasi grafik fungsi keanggotaan (bisa dibuat dengan matplotlib, excel, atau gambar sederhana)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Kajian Pustaka Kurang Referensi Ilmiah Jurnal Terakreditasi<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Kajian pustaka hanya menyebutkan&nbsp;5 jurnal, namun&nbsp;tanpa detail jurnal (DOI/link, instansi, skala nasional/internasional).<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Referensi cenderung dari skripsi atau jurnal dengan validasi minim, dan&nbsp;tidak mengacu ke jurnal internasional/Scopus/Sinta&nbsp;yang bisa memperkuat argumen metodologi.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran: Tambahkan minimal 1–2 referensi dari jurnal internasional tentang fuzzy Mamdani pada prediksi stok/persediaan.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">5.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Evaluasi terhadap Penelitian Terdahulu Masih Lemah<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Meskipun ada perbandingan, tidak dijelaskan&nbsp;kenapa penelitian sekarang lebih unggul secara teknis&nbsp;(misal: kompleksitas rule base, jumlah variabel input, platform implementasi, dll).<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Belum ada penjelasan mendalam tentang&nbsp;celah atau gap penelitian.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran: Tambahkan bagian kesimpulan kajian pustaka berupa:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 72pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Gap penelitian terdahulu<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 72pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Kontribusi baru penelitian ini<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 72pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Misalnya:&nbsp;“Belum ada penelitian yang mengevaluasi akurasi Fuzzy Mamdani dengan tiga metrik (MAE, RMSE, MAPE) secara langsung dalam sistem prediksi menu siap saji berbasis web yang dapat diakses oleh pengguna akhir.”<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>', '/ekapta-app-new/storage/app/public/lampirans/brZmSbyXug9oIIfmKtxr7Vddg08Rp7kjijuWLqhu.pdf', NULL, '2025-06-23 15:07:41', '2025-06-23 15:28:07', '2025-06-23 15:28:07', 1808, 19),
