(1473, '<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Terlalu Banyak Teori Umum yang Tidak Spesifik<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Banyak teori (misal: pengertian sistem, IMK, website, UML, ERD) dimasukkan terlalu panjang dan tidak semuanya relevan langsung dengan fokus penelitian.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 72pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Teori seperti website, IMK, bahkan UML secara lengkap bisa dijadikan lampiran jika tidak dipakai langsung di Bab III/IV.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 72pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Fokuskan hanya pada teori yang dipakai langsung untuk membangun sistem fuzzy dan basis datanya.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Penulisan</span> Teori Masih Terlalu Deskriptif<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Gaya bahasa seperti kutipan buku, bukan uraian yang fokus ke topik.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 72pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Ubahlah kalimat naratif menjadi reflektif-konseptual.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 108pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify;\">Misal: “Menurut Zadeh (1965), logika fuzzy memudahkan pengambilan keputusan berbasis linguistik seperti ‘tinggi’, ‘rendah’, yang tidak bisa ditangani logika biner.”<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">3.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Fungsi Keanggotaan Tidak Ada Visual<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Semua fungsi (segitiga, trapezium, gaussian) disebutkan, tetapi gambar visual bentuk kurva tidak disisipkan.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran: Sisipkan grafik atau visualisasi fungsi. Ini penting untuk dosen pembimbing/sidang agar memahami aplikasi fuzzy.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">4.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Penjelasan Fuzzy Mamdani Belum Dikaitkan ke Studi Kasus<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Belum ada penjelasan konkrit bagaimana variabel seperti stok, permintaan, dan produksi diformulasikan.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 72pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Tambahkan satu paragraf penghubung:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 108pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify;\">“Dalam penelitian ini, variabel input adalah permintaan dan persediaan, sedangkan outputnya adalah jumlah menu siap saji yang perlu diproduksi. Ketiganya diklasifikasikan menggunakan himpunan fuzzy (rendah, sedang, tinggi) dan diproses dengan aturan if-then dalam fuzzy Mamdani.”<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">5.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Kajian Pustaka Bagus, Tapi Kurang Ringkasan<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Tabel matriks sudah bagus, tapi belum ada kesimpulan naratif yang merangkum posisi penelitian ini.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Saran:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 72pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Tambahkan ringkasan:<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 72pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify;\">“Berbeda dari penelitian sebelumnya, penelitian ini tidak hanya mengimplementasikan sistem prediksi stok dengan Fuzzy Mamdani, tetapi juga mengevaluasi performanya dengan metrik MAE, RMSE, dan MAPE serta menyajikan antarmuka input dinamis berbasis web.”<o:p></o:p></p><div class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\"><hr size=\"0\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\"></span></div><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 36pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">6.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Tidak ada keterangan gambar berapa untuk Penulisan Rumus.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 54pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">·<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Pada beberapa rumus MAE, RMSE, dan MAPE terjadi beri gambar berapa?<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>', '/ekapta-app-new/storage/app/public/lampirans/39tYj1p9wIynaDJUScBo7uMdzGwePDq2TYWiqjSk.pdf', NULL, '2025-06-24 06:10:24', '2025-06-25 15:00:05', '2025-06-25 15:00:05', 1808, 19),
